 you know honestly there's the other  29 and a half billion properties to  build we only do rural so we only do the  rural bits  that still leaves you with you know five  or six million properties that are  improperly rural areas that we could be  serving that right now nobody's giving  them five or two so it's just a lot more  of the same I know that's slightly  boring repeat repeat repeat but that's  what we're going to do and in the  process of what you've discovered and  the experiences that you've been through  is there anything that you would say to  our colleagues in Europe trying to do  the same thing with rural areas yeah I  mean there are some great opportunities  with rural that are very different to  urban I mean it does cost more to build  these networks but the enthusiasm of the  of the people who live in and work in in  rural areas is massive because they they  honestly generally feel very left behind  by pretty much any other technical  development and if you take fiber into  their home or into their business you  know your catapulting them right to the  front of the queue and and they love it  so you know they are very loyal they are  very enthusiastic they are really keen  to help and that you need to harness  that while at the same time bearing in  mind you know this is a commercial  endeavor so you need to be focused on  making sure you you're building  infrastructure it's going to be there  for a long time that investors are keen  on supporting okay well congratulations  again and thanks for talking to us  thank you very much prime so  award-winning Giga clear bringing a lot  of satisfaction out in those rural areas  in Europe  [Music]  you

